It's been inside you this whole time,

248
00:14:39,580 --> 00:14:41,937
and you don't need a card
with a picture of some freaky

249
00:14:42,020 --> 00:14:44,777
-looking fisherman sitting
on a shark to inspire you.

250
00:14:44,860 --> 00:14:45,997
Do you hear what I'm saying?

251
00:14:46,080 --> 00:14:48,180
Back off! Look, man.

252
00:14:48,500 --> 00:14:53,057
What I'm trying to say is that you can be
inspired by your father without that card.

253
00:14:53,140 --> 00:14:56,317
There's something inside
every duelist that drives him.

254
00:14:56,400 --> 00:14:58,800
How would you know, Joey? I know.

255
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:01,437
Because I duel for my
little sister, Serenity,

256
00:15:01,520 --> 00:15:03,957
just the same way that
you duel for your dad.

257
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:07,257
And she inspires me even when
she's not right next to me.

258
00:15:07,340 --> 00:15:11,077
So don't be so hard on yourself for
destroying your legendary fisherman.

259
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:15,037
Your memories of your dad and your courage
are in your heart, not in that card.

260
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:16,897
And nothing can take that away.

261
00:15:16,980 --> 00:15:19,274
So let's get back to this duel already.

262
00:15:20,580 --> 00:15:22,040
Yes, and it's my attack.

263
00:15:22,420 --> 00:15:25,596
Fortress Whale, take out his
Panther Warrior for good.

264
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:32,100
I'm gonna have to stop you, Because
I activate Kunai with Chain.

265
00:15:34,140 --> 00:15:36,797
This card stops your
whale from attacking and

266
00:15:36,880 --> 00:15:39,920
raises my Panther Warrior's
attack points by 500.

267
00:15:42,540 --> 00:15:45,560
But I'm afraid my whale is still stronger.

268
00:15:46,640 --> 00:15:48,537
And your point is...

269
00:15:48,620 --> 00:15:51,220
Panther Warrior, attack his whale now.

270
00:15:52,040 --> 00:15:53,160
It can't.

271
00:15:55,760 --> 00:15:58,937
I already told you that my
Fortress Whale has more attack

272
00:15:59,020 --> 00:16:01,977
points than your Panther Warrior
even with its power boost.

273
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:04,760
So I'm afraid your
monster's been destroyed.

274
00:16:05,120 --> 00:16:08,797
It's true my Panther Warrior's attack
points are slightly lower than your Whale's,

275
00:16:08,880 --> 00:16:10,317
but you're forgetting one thing.

276
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:12,700
This little face-down card over here.

277
00:16:13,200 --> 00:16:14,480
What about it?

278
00:16:14,660 --> 00:16:15,900
I'm glad you asked.

279
00:16:16,180 --> 00:16:19,239
It's got just the power
boost that my monster needs.

280
00:16:21,060 --> 00:16:25,537
Lightning Blade's Electrical Jolt raises
my Panther's attack points by 800,

281
00:16:25,620 --> 00:16:28,620
which means your whale's going down.

282
00:16:32,040 --> 00:16:33,520
He did it!

283
00:16:33,740 --> 00:16:36,100
And there go most of your light coins.

284
00:16:36,500 --> 00:16:37,520
Any last words?

285
00:16:37,980 --> 00:16:39,300
Yes, six.

286
00:16:39,540 --> 00:16:42,197
This duel is not over yet.

287
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:45,640
So I'll play this, Return of the Doomed.

288
00:16:45,740 --> 00:16:48,977
It brings back one of my monsters
and hides it under water.

289
00:16:49,060 --> 00:16:50,640
That's not good.

290
00:16:51,160 --> 00:16:51,990
Oh, no.

291
00:16:52,180 --> 00:16:54,257
One of Mako's monsters is back again.

292
00:16:54,340 --> 00:16:55,480
Come on now, Joey.

293
00:16:56,140 --> 00:16:57,160
All right, Mako.

294
00:16:58,380 --> 00:16:59,320
Here goes.

295
00:17:00,060 --> 00:17:01,080
Giant True Name.

296
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:03,477
This card sends all magic and trap cards

297
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:05,337
back to the player's
hands and off the field.

298
00:17:05,420 --> 00:17:08,397
So I could use it to dry
up Mako's ocean and expose

299
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:10,737
whatever monster he brought
back from his graveyard.

300
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:15,037
But what if my Panther Warrior can't
defeat whatever's hiding down there?

301
00:17:15,120 --> 00:17:17,360
What on earth are you waiting for?

302
00:17:17,820 --> 00:17:22,761
Hurry up and make your move so my Creature
of the Deep can strike and end this duel.

303
00:17:23,260 --> 00:17:24,090
Wait,

304
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:28,177
when Mako covered the field in ocean water,
it gave his sea monsters a power boost.

305
00:17:28,260 --> 00:17:32,436
But if I dry things up, it'll lower
his hidden monster's attack points.

306
00:17:33,660 --> 00:17:35,400
Activate Giant True Name!

307
00:17:36,100 --> 00:17:37,000
Drain the sea!

308
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:45,860
It worked!

309
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,020
You've exposed my fisherman.

310
00:17:52,540 --> 00:17:54,040
It's all over now.

311
00:17:54,340 --> 00:17:55,580
Just finish him off.

312
00:17:55,820 --> 00:17:57,917
It's been an honor to duel you, Mako.

313
00:17:58,000 --> 00:17:59,820
Now I play scapegoat.

314
00:18:02,020 --> 00:18:05,800
And I sacrifice one of them so
my Panther Warrior can attack.

315
00:18:12,920 --> 00:18:14,980
I'll never give up, Father.

316
00:18:25,700 --> 00:18:27,180
You all right, Mako?

317
00:18:28,180 --> 00:18:30,140
Yes, that was an excellent duel.

318
00:18:30,660 --> 00:18:31,601
Congratulations.

319
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:32,630
Thank you.

320
00:18:32,713 --> 00:18:34,366
Here are my two rarest cards.

321
00:18:34,580 --> 00:18:36,060
And two locator cards.

322
00:18:36,540 --> 00:18:37,460
Hold on.

323
00:18:37,740 --> 00:18:40,217
You don't need to give
me your fisherman card.

324
00:18:40,300 --> 00:18:41,237
Yes, I do.

325
00:18:41,320 --> 00:18:42,860
You earned these cards.

326
00:18:43,420 --> 00:18:44,517
Besides, you were right.

327
00:18:44,600 --> 00:18:47,140
I don't need a card to remember my dad.

328
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:50,800
His courage and support are
always with me inside my heart.

329
00:18:50,920 --> 00:18:51,750
That's right.

330
00:18:53,540 --> 00:18:54,420
Thank you.

331
00:18:55,100 --> 00:18:56,320
And don't worry.

332
00:18:56,960 --> 00:18:58,620
I'll treat it with respect.

333
00:18:59,260 --> 00:19:00,300
You'd better.

334
00:19:00,580 --> 00:19:03,240
And best of luck in the finals. Thanks.

335
00:19:03,420 --> 00:19:04,773
You're all right, Nico.

336
00:19:10,340 --> 00:19:11,170
Mr.

337
00:19:11,253 --> 00:19:14,940
Kaiba, Joey Wheeler's dual
desk was traced to Sector 075.

338
00:19:15,480 --> 00:19:16,340
Good work.

339
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:19,955
Our satellite tracking system
found your friends, Yugi.

340
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:21,317
Well, then where is he?

341
00:19:21,400 --> 00:19:23,660
Hey, not so fast.

342
00:19:23,980 --> 00:19:26,600
I'll tell you exactly
what you want to know.

343
00:19:27,140 --> 00:19:31,700
That is, if you agree to duel me as
soon as we find them. That's enough!

344
00:19:31,860 --> 00:19:33,389
This is not a game, Kaiba!

345
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:36,700
My friends are in jeopardy
and they need my help.

346
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:38,777
A madman is after them.

347
00:19:38,860 --> 00:19:42,880
And I already accepted your
challenge, so you will get your duel.

348
00:19:43,340 --> 00:19:46,520
As soon as I know my
friends are safe from harm.

349
00:19:46,920 --> 00:19:51,273
Well, if that's the case, then I think
you had better follow me right now.

350
00:19:51,400 --> 00:19:53,320
I hope that we're not too late.
